      "get": {
        "operationId": "getPreconfiguredTaxRates",
        "summary": "GET Get Preconfigured Tax Rates",
        "description": "Retrieve the full list of preconfigured tax rates from the built-in tax rates data file. These are the default rates organized by continent/region (`EU`, `NA`, `SA`, `AS`, `AF`, `OC`, `REST`) and country.\n\n**Required permission:** `store/settings`",
